589	    /**
590	     * Counts the existing owners (before this create) belonging to the given household, i.e. those
591	     * whose stored {@code householdId} equals the value derived for the owner being created. The
592	     * count reflects only owners already persisted at the time of the create, so the owner being
593	     * created is never included; callers add one to obtain the household size after this create.
594	     *
595	     * @param householdId the household identifier derived for the owner being created (see
596	     *                    {@link HouseholdNormalizer#toHouseholdId})
597	     * @return the number of existing owners already sharing that household
598	     */
