657	     * Derives the household id an owner should carry from its submitted fields (see
658	     * {@link HouseholdNormalizer#toHouseholdId}). Both create and update stamp an owner with a
659	     * household id, so routing them through this single method keeps them agreed on which of the
660	     * owner's fields key the household.
661	     *
662	     * @param ownerFieldsDto the submitted owner fields (its identifying fields are non-blank here,
663	     *                       {@link #rejectBlankOwnerFields} having already run on create)
664	     * @return the owner's household id
665	     */
666	    private String householdIdFor(OwnerFieldsDto ownerFieldsDto) {
